  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Gullipud</defName>
    <label>gullipud</label>
    <description>Gullipuds were bulky, loose-skinned, self-inflating amphibians native to the swamps of the planet Naboo. As they were small and easy prey for other animals, like pikobis, gullipuds would extend their spine to make themselves harder to catch and swallow. Due to their physical similarities to the more common gorg these creatures may have been unintentionally transported to various worlds as livestock, only to escape into the wild and establish themselves.</description>
